<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<title>Multiplex, the SSH tmux terminal for Vision Pro, iPad, and iPhone</title>
<meta name="description" content="A spatial SSH terminal for remote tmux. Every session is a live monitor on a wall; attaching opens it in its own window. For Apple Vision Pro, iPad, and iPhone.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Multiplex, the SSH tmux terminal">
<meta property="og:description" content="Every tmux session as a live monitor on a wall. Attach opens it in its own window.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://multiplexterm.dev/assets/og.png">
<meta property="og:image:width" content="2400">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="1260">
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="Multiplex — every tmux session, a live monitor on a wall. The spatial SSH terminal for Apple Vision Pro, iPad, and iPhone.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://multiplexterm.dev/">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://multiplexterm.dev/assets/og.png">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1024 1024'%3E%3Crect width='1024' height='1024' rx='212' fill='%2317181A'/%3E%3Cg fill='%23F2F3F4'%3E%3Crect x='96' y='654' width='832' height='68'/%3E%3Crect x='262' y='284' width='68' height='438'/%3E%3Crect x='694' y='284' width='68' height='438'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Cpolyline points='296,304 512,600 728,304' fill='none' stroke='%23F2F3F4' stroke-width='68'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='512' cy='600' r='40' fill='%23E5484D'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style is:inline>
  /* ── TALLY tokens (DESIGN.md, Frost light chassis) ──────────────────── */
  :root{
    --chassis:#E4E8EE;      /* page ground                                */
    --bezel:#F0F3F7;        /* raised cards                               */
    --line:#CDD3DC;         /* the visible line                           */
    --screen:#F9FBFD;       /* brightest surface: screens read as paper   */
    --ink:#191E25;
    --ink2:#515C69;
    --ink3:#87919E;
    --tally:#C13439;
    --caution:#966618;
    --ok:#3E7C58;
    --mini:#3A434E;
    --graphite:#17181A;     /* the dark chassis, quoted in components     */
    --sans:system-ui,-apple-system,"SF Pro Text","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
    --mono:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,"Liberation Mono",monospace;
    --w:1160px;
    --shadow:0 24px 60px -24px rgba(25,30,37,.28);
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
  body{
    background:var(--chassis);color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
    overflow-x:clip;
  }
  /* wide mono content (terminal previews, code) must never widen the page */
  .hero-grid>*,.split>*,.cell,.plan{min-width:0}
  ::selection{background:rgba(193,52,57,.22)}
  a{color:inherit}
  img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--w);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  .lbl{font-weight:700;font-stretch:condensed;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em}
  .mono{font-family:var(--mono)}

  /* ── nav ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  header{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;
    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--chassis) 86%,transparent);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;height:64px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none}
  .brand svg{width:26px;height:26px;color:var(--ink)}
  .brand .lbl{font-size:15px}
  .nav-links{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:4px}
  .nav-links a{
    text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink2);font-size:14px;
    padding:8px 14px;border-radius:0;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);background:var(--bezel)}
  .nav-links a:active{transform:translateY(1px)}

  /* ── hero ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero{padding:84px 0 76px;overflow:hidden}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.08fr);gap:48px;align-items:center}
  .eyebrow{color:var(--ink3);font-size:11px;margin-bottom:22px}
  h1{
    font-weight:750;font-stretch:condensed;letter-spacing:-.015em;
    font-size:clamp(2.9rem,5.8vw,4.8rem);line-height:1.0;
    margin-bottom:24px;text-wrap:balance;
  }
  .hero p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:19px;max-width:36ch;margin-bottom:36px}
  .hero p strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  .asb{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;text-decoration:none;
    background:#000;border-radius:11px;padding:10px 19px 11px 15px;
    transition:opacity .15s ease;
  }
  .asb:hover{opacity:.86}
  .asb:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .asb svg{width:27px;height:27px;fill:#fff;flex:none}
  .asb-txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.16;color:#fff}
  .asb-txt small{font-size:11px;font-weight:400}
  .asb-txt b{font-size:21px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em}

  .cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}

  /* The device lineup: Vision Pro, iPad, iPhone on one baseline at true
     relative physical scale. Widths as % of the cluster derive from real
     hardware widths: Vision Pro ~203 mm -> 51.2%, iPad Pro 11" 177.5 mm
     -> 44.8%, iPhone 71.9 mm -> 18.1%. Screenshots are real captures;
     the frames add each device's actual bezel share. */
  .devices{
    /* bleed into the page's outer margin, never past the viewport edge */
    --bleed:clamp(24px, calc((100vw - var(--w))/2 + 24px), 140px);
    position:relative;width:min(680px,calc(100% + var(--bleed)));
    aspect-ratio:250/166;
    margin:0 calc(-1*var(--bleed)) -76px auto;align-self:end;
  }
  .devices>*{position:absolute;bottom:0}
  .dev-vp{width:51.2%;left:0;z-index:1}
  .dev-pad{
      width:44.8%;left:45.8%;aspect-ratio:1775/2497;z-index:2;
    background:#0c0d0e;border-radius:18px;padding:2.2%;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow),0 0 0 1px rgba(25,30,37,.35);
  }
  .dev-pad img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px}
  .dev-phone{
    width:18.1%;left:81.9%;aspect-ratio:719/1500;z-index:3;
    background:#0c0d0e;border-radius:15px;padding:1.05%;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow),0 0 0 1px rgba(25,30,37,.35);
  }
  .dev-phone img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:11px}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
    .devices>*{animation:rise .9s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both}
    .dev-vp{animation-delay:.1s}
    .dev-pad{animation-delay:.26s}
    .dev-phone{animation-delay:.42s}
    @keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(34px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  }

  /* ── sections ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  section{padding:110px 0}
  h2{
    font-weight:750;font-stretch:condensed;letter-spacing:-.01em;
    font-size:clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3rem);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:18px;text-wrap:balance;
  }
  .sub{color:var(--ink2);font-size:18px;max-width:60ch}
  .sub strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  /* wall band */
  .wallband{border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bezel)}
  .wallband .wrap{padding-top:110px}
  .wallband .head{max-width:62ch;margin-bottom:56px}
  .wallband img{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:none;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}

  /* alternating splits */
  .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:72px;align-items:center}
  .split + .split{margin-top:110px}
  .crop{
    border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--graphite);
    aspect-ratio:5/4;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .crop img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:bottom}
  .feat-list{list-style:none;margin-top:26px;display:grid;gap:16px}
  .feat-list li{padding-left:18px;border-left:2px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink2)}
  .feat-list b{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .feat-list .pro{color:var(--ink3);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;margin-left:6px}

  /* light terminal preview: Tally Frost (screens brighter than frames) */
  .term{background:var(--bezel);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .term-screen{
    background:var(--screen);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:20px 20px 24px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--mini);white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .term-screen .dim{color:var(--ink3)}
  .term-screen .amb{color:var(--caution)}
  .term-screen .ok{color:var(--ok)}
  .term-screen .qr{display:block;width:128px;height:128px;margin:12px 2px 14px;color:var(--mini)}
  .strip{padding:10px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}
  .strip .who{font-weight:700;font-stretch:condensed;letter-spacing:.09em;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink2);text-transform:uppercase;padding:0 8px 0 2px}
  .chip{
    font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--screen);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;cursor:default;
  }
  .chip:hover{border-color:var(--ink3)}
  .chip.warm{color:#7A5A33}
  .umdrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 12px}
  .umdrow .lbl{font-size:10.5px}
  .needs{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-weight:700;font-stretch:condensed;letter-spacing:.09em;font-size:8.5px;color:var(--caution);text-transform:uppercase}
  .needs i{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--caution)}
  .umdrow .tel{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ink3)}

  /* bento */
  .bento{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:48px}
  .cell{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bezel);padding:28px}
  .cell h3{font-weight:700;font-stretch:condensed;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .cell p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:15.5px}
  .cell .pro{color:var(--ink3);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px}
  .c-mosh{grid-column:span 7;background:var(--screen)}
  .c-mosh .wire{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink3);margin-top:22px}
  .c-mosh .wire b{color:var(--ok);font-weight:400}
  .c-file{grid-column:span 5}
  .c-file code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--mini);background:var(--screen);border:1px solid var(--line);display:block;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:18px;white-space:pre;overflow-x:auto}
  .c-view{grid-column:span 6}
  .c-fv{grid-column:span 6}
  .c-termcell{grid-column:span 5}
  .c-termcell ul{list-style:none;margin-top:12px;display:grid;gap:6px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:14px}
  .c-termcell ul b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .c-termcell figure{margin:22px -28px -28px;overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .c-termcell img{width:100%;height:70px;object-fit:cover;object-position:bottom center}
  .c-widget{grid-column:span 4}
  .c-priv{grid-column:span 3;background:var(--graphite);border-color:var(--graphite);color:#F2F3F4}
  .c-priv h3{color:#F2F3F4}
  .c-priv p{color:#9BA1A6}
  .c-priv .mono{display:block;margin-top:16px;font-size:11px;color:#C8D2D6;line-height:2}

  /* pricing */
  .plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.25fr);gap:12px;margin-top:48px}
  .plan{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bezel);padding:32px}
  .plan.pro{background:var(--graphite);border-color:var(--graphite);color:#F2F3F4;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .plan-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;margin-bottom:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .plan-head .lbl{font-size:14px}
  .iap{
    font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;
    color:#9BA1A6;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);padding:2px 7px;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .iap.soon{color:#F2F3F4;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
  .price{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink3)}
  .price b{font-weight:500;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink)}
  .plan.pro .price{color:#9BA1A6}
  .plan.pro .price b{color:#F2F3F4}
  .plan-sub{color:var(--ink3);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px}
  .plan.pro .plan-sub{color:#9BA1A6}
  .plan ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:10px;color:var(--ink2);font-size:15px}
  .plan.pro ul{color:#C8D2D6}
  .plan ul li{padding-left:16px;position:relative}
  .plan ul li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.62em;width:7px;height:2px;background:var(--ink3)}
  .plan.pro ul li::before{background:#F2F3F4}
  .plan .asb{margin-top:28px;background:#fff}
  .plan .asb svg{fill:#000}
  .plan .asb-txt{color:#000}
  .fine{margin-top:38px;color:var(--ink3);font-size:13.5px;max-width:72ch}
  .fine code{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:44px 0 60px;color:var(--ink3);font-size:13.5px}
  .foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .foot .brand svg{width:20px;height:20px}
  .foot a{color:var(--ink2);text-decoration:none}
  .foot a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
  .foot .spacer{flex:1}

  .rev{opacity:1;transform:none}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
    .rev{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),transform .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
    .rev.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  }

  @media (max-width:960px){
    .hero{padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:64px}
    .hero-grid,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px}
    .split + .split{margin-top:80px}
    .split.rtl .crop{order:-1}
    .devices{margin:0 auto -64px;width:min(600px,94vw)}
    .c-mosh,.c-file,.c-view,.c-fv,.c-termcell,.c-widget,.c-priv{grid-column:span 12}
    .plans{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    section{padding:80px 0}
    .wallband .wrap{padding-top:80px}
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){
    .nav-links a:not(.keep){display:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Multiplex">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" aria-hidden="true">
        <g fill="currentColor">
          <rect x="0" y="654" width="1024" height="68"/>
          <rect x="262" y="284" width="68" height="438"/>
          <rect x="694" y="284" width="68" height="438"/>
        </g>
        <polyline points="296,304 512,600 728,304" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="68" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter"/>
        <circle cx="512" cy="600" r="40" fill="#C13439"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="lbl">Multiplex</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Sections">
      <a href="#wall">The wall</a>
      <a href="#agents">Agents</a>
      <a class="keep" href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <!-- ══ HERO ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow lbl">An SSH terminal for Apple Vision Pro, iPad &amp; iPhone</p>
        <h1>Every session, its own window.</h1>
        <p>Multiplex is a spatial <strong>SSH terminal for remote tmux</strong>. See every session live on a wall, then attach it anywhere.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="asb" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6790074057">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.152 6.896c-.948 0-2.415-1.078-3.96-1.04-2.04.027-3.91 1.183-4.961 3.014-2.117 3.675-.546 9.103 1.519 12.09 1.013 1.454 2.208 3.09 3.792 3.031 1.52-.065 2.09-.987 3.935-.987 1.831 0 2.35.987 3.96.948 1.637-.026 2.676-1.48 3.676-2.948 1.156-1.688 1.636-3.325 1.662-3.415-.039-.013-3.182-1.221-3.22-4.857-.026-3.04 2.48-4.494 2.597-4.559-1.429-2.09-3.623-2.324-4.39-2.376-2-.156-3.675 1.09-4.61 1.09zM15.53 3.83c.843-1.012 1.4-2.427 1.245-3.83-1.207.052-2.662.805-3.532 1.818-.78.896-1.454 2.338-1.273 3.714 1.338.104 2.715-.688 3.559-1.701"/></svg>
            <span class="asb-txt"><small>Download on the</small><b>App Store</b></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="devices" role="group" aria-label="Multiplex runs on Apple Vision Pro, iPad, and iPhone, shown at their relative physical sizes">
        <div class="dev-vp">
          <img src="assets/visionpro.webp" width="1044" height="694" alt="Apple Vision Pro">
        </div>
        <div class="dev-pad">
          <img src="assets/ipad-deck.png" width="2064" height="2752" alt="The Multiplex deck on iPad: a grid of live tmux session tiles for host devbox" fetchpriority="high">
        </div>
        <div class="dev-phone">
          <img src="assets/iphone-deck.png" width="1260" height="2736" alt="The Multiplex deck on iPhone: a column of live session tiles, one wearing a red LIVE tally">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ THE WALL ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="wallband" id="wall">
    <div class="wrap rev">
      <div class="head">
        <h2>A monitor wall for your fleet.</h2>
        <p class="sub">Hosts probe concurrently over SSH and every tmux session appears as a live tile: its <strong>actual last lines</strong>, one spine segment per window, a red <strong>LIVE</strong> tally while you are attached. On Vision Pro, the wall hangs in your room.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="assets/visionos-deck.jpg" width="2400" height="1350" alt="The Multiplex deck on Apple Vision Pro: a dark monitor wall of live tmux session tiles floating in a living room" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ SPLIT: HONEST STATE ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section>
    <div class="wrap split rev">
      <div class="crop">
        <img src="assets/ipad-windows.png" width="2400" height="1800" alt="Three Multiplex windows tiled side by side on iPad: the deck and two live terminal sessions, each its own scene" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Real multi-window, on iPad and Vision&nbsp;Pro.</h2>
        <p class="sub">Every attached session is its own window: floating spatial windows you place around the room on Vision Pro, real scenes in Stage Manager and Split View on iPad. Merge windows into tabs and split them back out; the <strong>SSH connection</strong>, buffer, and scrollback move with the tab. Detach, and the wall still shows it running.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ SPLIT: AGENTS ══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="agents" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap split rtl rev">
      <div>
        <h2>Watch over Claude Code, from anywhere.</h2>
        <p class="sub">Multiplex spots Claude Code, Codex, and Pi in every pane, right on the wall.</p>
        <ul class="feat-list">
          <li><b>One-tap command chips</b>Stop, clear, compact, model and thinking switches follow the foreground agent, even in a plain SSH shell.</li>
          <li><b>Custom commands that travel</b>Per host and per agent, multiline if you like, synced to your other devices with the host.</li>
          <li><b>Alerts when it needs you<span class="pro">PRO</span></b>A finished turn, a question, a permission prompt: get notified instead of babysitting.</li>
          <li><b>Prompt history with jump<span class="pro">PRO</span></b>Every prompt from Claude Code's own session file, one tap to jump the transcript back to it.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="term" role="img" aria-label="A Multiplex terminal in the light Tally Frost theme running Claude Code, with the agent command strip and a NEEDS YOU flag">
        <div class="term-screen"><span class="dim">&#10095;</span> ship the widget timeline fix
<span class="dim">&#9679; I&rsquo;ll update the reload gate first&hellip;</span>

<span class="amb">&#10033; Waiting on Bash(git push)</span>
<span class="dim">  Allow? (y/n)</span></div>
        <div class="strip">
          <span class="who">&#10033; Claude Code</span>
          <span class="chip">STOP</span>
          <span class="chip">/clear</span>
          <span class="chip">/compact</span>
          <span class="chip">THINK</span>
          <span class="chip warm">deploy st&hellip;</span>
          <span class="chip">MORE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="umdrow">
          <span class="lbl">Claude &middot; Devbox</span>
          <span class="needs"><i></i>Needs you</span>
          <span class="tel">TMUX &middot; PANE 0</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ SPLIT: BIND ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section style="padding-top:0">
